>   "(3) THE RIGHTS BASED ON PRIOR USE UNDER THIS SECTION ARE NOT A GENERAL
> LICENSE UNDER ALL CLAIMS OF THE PATENT, BUT ARE RESTRICTED IN SCOPE TO
